Package: arma.panel.ife
Type: Package
Title: ARMA Dynamics in Panel Models with Interactive Effects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pablo", "Mones", email = "pm3257@columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jushan", "Bai", role = "aut"),
    person("Yiqun", "Chen", role = "ctb"))
Description: Gaussian quasi-maximum likelihood and second-moment generalized
    method of moments estimation for short dynamic panels with autoregressive
    moving-average dynamics and interactive effects. Supports strictly exogenous
    regressors in estimation and joint selection of autoregressive order,
    moving-average order, and factor count without regressors. Implements the
    methods described in Bai and Mones (2026), 'Likelihood and Order Selection
    for ARMA Dynamics in Panel Models with Interactive Effects' (manuscript).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: numDeriv, stats, utils
NeedsCompilation: no
Packaged: 2026-11-18 02:26:44 UTC; 14426
